[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="AccountPanelStyle"]
; No dedicated Account-screen panel art exists (Pause/Settings/Level-Complete panel
; textures each bake in their OWN title text, e.g. bs_panel_settings_portrait.png
; literally paints the word "SETTINGS" - confirmed by a RENDERED screenshot during
; this pass, see CLAUDE.md rule 10's "never bake in..." precedent for why reusing one
; here would be wrong, not just a style choice). A plain StyleBoxFlat in the shared
; blue/cyan sci-fi palette is used instead until dedicated Account panel art exists.
